Cached responses from the data-augmentation source (Task 3), in CSV.

This directory IS committed to git, unlike the other data/ directories. Two reasons:
  1. The assignment asks for a local copy, since "repeated retrieval may be
     time-consuming and subject to API limits".
  2. It lets the rest of the group build against real augmented data without
     needing their own API credentials.

This file exists only because git does not track empty directories.
